OL,3,GNEWSAWoman charged after 'false bomb   
OL,4,Aclaim' at hospital                     
OL,6,FA woman has been charged over what     
OL,7,Fpolice described as a "false claim"    
OL,8,Fthat a bomb had been left in a suitcase
OL,9,Fin a hospital.                         
OL,11,FJessica Renshaw, of Gort Lane, in      
OL,12,FAtherton, Wigan, was charged with      
OL,13,Fcommunicating false information after  
OL,14,Fan incident at the Royal Albert Edward 
OL,15,FInfirmary, Wigan, on Wednesday.        
OL,17,FPart of the site was evacuated, with   
OL,18,Fthe hospital temporarily asking some   
OL,19,Fpatients without life-threatening      
OL,20,Femergencies to go elsewhere.           
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
